# =============================================================================
# Git tracking policy
#
# KEEP (project):
#   src/, scripts/, configs/, docs/*.md, tests/
#   experiments/**/README.md, STATUS.md, comments/*.md  (orientation / notes)
#   experiments/**/heldout_list.yaml  (experimental-design source of truth)
#   experiments/loo_encoding/*.py, slurm/protocol_A*.yaml  (LOO cluster pipeline)
#   experiments/noise_ceiling_roi/nc_roi_utils.py  (shared NC helpers used by LOO)
#   experiments/noise_ceiling_roi/rois/global_noise_ceiling_hull__mask.npy
#
# IGNORE (local / regenerable):
#   experiments/**/*.py       (scripts that generate figures/reports; except LOO / NC utils)
#   figures, plots, PDFs, CSVs, JSON/YAML ROIs, npy/joblib/npz
#   generated experiment report .md (except README/STATUS/comments)
#   experiments/**/runs/, experiments/**/models/, experiment logs
# =============================================================================

# Shared workspace data (sibling Data/ directory).
# Anchor at repo root (`/Data/`) so case-insensitive macOS git does not also
# ignore the Python package `src/data/` via the `Data/` pattern.
/Data/
../Data/

# Project-generated artifacts (under shared Data/)
# Tracked only via configs; never commit processed arrays.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Results / figures / reports (regenerated by pipeline or experiments)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
plots/
**/figures/
experiments/**/plots/
experiments/**/runs/
experiments/**/models/
experiments/**/logs/
*.png
*.pdf
*.npy
!experiments/noise_ceiling_roi/rois/global_noise_ceiling_hull__mask.npy
*.npz
*.joblib

# Experiment result tables / inventories / generated metrics
experiments/**/*.csv
experiments/**/*.json
experiments/**/*.txt

# Generated experiment YAML (ROIs, taxonomies, etc.); keep design heldout lists
experiments/**/*.yaml
experiments/**/*.yml
!experiments/**/heldout_list.yaml
!experiments/loo_encoding/slurm/protocol_A*.yaml

# Experiment scripts that create figures/reports
experiments/**/*.py
!experiments/loo_encoding/*.py
!experiments/noise_ceiling_roi/nc_roi_utils.py

# Generated experiment markdown reports; keep orientation + human review notes
experiments/**/*.md
!experiments/**/README.md
!experiments/**/STATUS.md
!experiments/**/comments/**/*.md

# Other local / exploratory outputs
exploratory/**/results/

runs/
checkpoints/
checkpoints*/
logs/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*

# Jupyter / IDE
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Test / coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
